<Slide
  style={{
    width: '1280px', height: '720px',
    background: '#F5F7FA',
    padding: '20px 60px',
    fontFamily: '"思源黑体", sans-serif',
  }}
>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', width: '100%', height: '100%', gap: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 360, paddingTop: 20 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FF9F1C', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2, marginBottom: 12 }}>CONTEXT ENGINEERING</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#16263F', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 24 }}>
        上下文工程：<br />喂什么，比怎么喂更重要
      </Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 4, background: '#22D3EE', marginBottom: 24 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        信息不足会乱猜，信息过载会分心。核心原则：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F' }}>可见即存在</span>——没进上下文的，等于不存在。
      </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='eye' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 5 }}>可见即存在</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>没放进上下文的规则、文件、约定，对模型就是「不存在」。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#16263F', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: 'rgba(255,159,28,0.15)', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='map' style={{ fill: '#FF9F1C', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginBottom: 5 }}>AGENTS.md 导航地图</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#DCE7F5', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>把「去哪找、找什么」写清楚——地图优于百科全书，先导航后展开。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, padding: '18px 22px', boxShadow: '0 2px 12px rgba(22,38,63,0.06)' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 13, background: '#EAF2FB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <FAIcon name='balance-scale' style={{ fill: '#22D3EE', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#16263F', marginBottom: 5 }}>信息要恰到好处</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>太少→瞎猜，太多→分心。只给当前任务真正需要的上下文。</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 14, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>AI 从零开始 · 第 8 讲</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5B6B7A' }}>05 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
